part places
  tally 1
  note "Places of the household (story § What we had on 1 January 2021, and the accounts opened later), their owners and their openings at the start, 2021-01-01."
  note "Money from and to the world goes to the built-in outside places (outside_duk, and outside_<unit> for units, L §5.9)."

place joint: account DUK

place lazur: account DUK

place ania_sav: account DUK

place zosia_sav: account DUK

place wrap_cash: account DUK

place wrap_glb: holding fund_u priced px_glb

place wrap_bnd: holding fund_u priced px_bnd

place rzt_cash: account DUK

place rzt_em: holding fund_u priced px_em

place rzt_idx: holding fund_u priced px_idx

place rzt_div: holding fund_u priced px_div

place rzt_glb: holding fund_u priced px_glb

place rza_cash: account DUK

place rza_glb: holding fund_u priced px_glb

place rza_mm: holding fund_u priced px_mm

place kop_glb: holding fund_u priced px_glb

place wcp_t: holding fund_u priced px_wcp

place wcp_a: holding fund_u priced px_wcp

place deposit: claim DUK

input owns[s in spouse, x in place]: num question "What share of this place is this spouse's?"
  note "CIV-1: what either spouse acquires during the marriage is community property, held half each (A-HR5 .1); what one got by gift or inheritance, or in exchange for it, is that spouse's alone (CIV-1 .3, A-HR5 .2)"

version openings
